24. What NOT to do

Tell your friend:

❌ Don't hardcode users

Don't do:

const name = "Kushagra Srivastava";

or:

Hi, Ananya Singh
❌ Don't create duplicate Supabase clients

Use the existing client.

❌ Don't put service-role keys in frontend code

Only publishable/anon browser-safe keys belong in the frontend.

❌ Don't replace index.html entirely

Especially not with a generated version.

❌ Don't fix database problems by changing random frontend queries

First inspect the actual schema.

❌ Don't trust demo arrays

If something uses:

NOTICES
CONTENT
demo
sample

assume it needs investigation before calling it a real backend feature.

