27. The single most important thing

Your friend doesn't need to understand the entire 500+ KB index.html on day one.

Start with these files:

1. index.html
2. supabase-auth.js
3. student-profile-sync.js
4. registration-approval.js
5. registration-review-ui.js

Understand those first.

The current auth module handles the Supabase connection and authentication/profile routing.

The student sync handles the student-specific database → UI pipeline.

The registration modules handle pending registration requests, approval/rejection, notifications, and realtime refresh.

